{"slug":"steve-chabot","qid":"Q506694","name":"Steve Chabot","desc":"American politician (born 1953)","article":"Steve Chabot","born":"1953-01-22","died":null,"birthplace":"Cincinnati","parties":["Republican Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"OH-01","f":2011,"u":2023},{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"OH-01","f":1995,"u":2009}],"summary":"Steven Joseph Chabot ( SHAB-ət; born January 22, 1953) is an American politician and lawyer who represented Ohio's 1st congressional district in the United States House of Representatives from 1995 to 2009 and again from 2011 to 2023. A member of the Republican Party, he lost his 2008 reelection bid to Democrat Steve Driehaus, before reclaiming his seat in 2010, and losing his 2022 reelection bid to Democrat Greg Landsman. Until his second election loss, he was the dean of Ohio's GOP delegation to the House of Representatives, after the retirement of former Speaker John Boehner.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":2022,"o":"H","k":"OH-01","p":"R","v":140058,"s":47.24,"w":false,"n":"Steve Chabot"},{"y":2020,"o":"H","k":"OH-01","p":"R","v":199560,"s":51.8,"w":true,"n":"Steve Chabot"},{"y":2018,"o":"H","k":"OH-01","p":"R","v":154409,"s":51.32,"w":true,"n":"Steve Chabot"},{"y":2016,"o":"H","k":"OH-01","p":"R","v":210014,"s":59.19,"w":true,"n":"Steve Chabot"},{"y":2014,"o":"H","k":"OH-01","p":"R","v":124779,"s":63.22,"w":true,"n":"Steve Chabot"},{"y":2012,"o":"H","k":"OH-01","p":"R","v":201907,"s":57.73,"w":true,"n":"Steve Chabot"},{"y":2010,"o":"H","k":"OH-01","p":"R","v":103770,"s":51.49,"w":true,"n":"Steve Chabot"},{"y":2008,"o":"H","k":"OH-01","p":"R","v":140683,"s":47.48,"w":false,"n":"Steve Chabot"},{"y":2006,"o":"H","k":"OH-01","p":"R","v":105680,"s":52.25,"w":true,"n":"Steve Chabot"},{"y":2004,"o":"H","k":"OH-01","p":"R","v":173430,"s":59.83,"w":true,"n":"Steve Chabot"},{"y":2002,"o":"H","k":"OH-01","p":"R","v":110760,"s":64.8,"w":true,"n":"Steve Chabot"},{"y":2000,"o":"H","k":"OH-01","p":"R","v":116768,"s":52.97,"w":tru